{\n            MDC.clear();\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static String statusClass(int status) {\n        return (status / 100) + \"xx\";\n    }\n\n    private static String firstNonBlank(String value, String fallback) {\n        return value == null || value.isBlank() ? fallback : value;\n    }\n}\n"
